{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:55:46+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:55:46+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Maire S.p.A.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","country":"Italy","city":"Milan","website":"https://www.groupmaire.com","employees":7884,"summary":"MAIRE S.p.A. engages in the provision of solutions in the field of green chemistry and energy transition technologies. The company operates through two segments, Integrated E&C Solutions and Sustainable Technology Solutions. The Integrated E&C Solutions segment offers services and solutions for a low-carbon future, such as feed, engineering services, procurement and construction, as well as the upgrading and revamping of existing assets through its network of engineering hubs and operating centers. The Sustainable Technology Solutions provides technology solutions, including technology licensing, process design package basic engineering design, proprietary equipment and catalysts, digital solutions, and selected specialty solutions. It also offers nitrogen, hydrogen and circular carbon, fuels and chemical, polymer solutions. MAIRE S.p.A. was formerly known as Maire Tecnimont S.p.A. and changed its name to Maire S.p.A. in April 2024. The company is headquartered in Milan, Italy. Maire S.p.A. operates as a subsidiary of Glv Capital S.P.A.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"MAIRE S.p.A. s’engage dans la fourniture de solutions dans le domaine de la chimie verte et des technologies de transition énergétique. La société opère à travers deux segments, les solutions E&C intégrées et les solutions technologiques durables. Le segment Solutions E&C intégrées offre des services et des solutions pour un avenir à faibles émissions de carbone, tels que l'alimentation animale, les services d'ingénierie, les achats et la construction, ainsi que la mise à niveau et la refonte des actifs existants grâce à son réseau de centres d'ingénierie et d'exploitation."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":4228443648,"shares_outstanding":327278925,"trailing_pe":15.380953,"forward_pe":12.725679,"price_to_book":6.5750637,"ev_to_ebitda":10.423,"ev_to_revenue":0.627,"dividend_yield":0.044899996,"payout_ratio":0.6931,"beta_yahoo":null},"targets":{"current_price":12.92,"mean":17.01,"median":17.5,"high":19.0,"low":13.3,"n_analysts":10,"reco_mean":1.8,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-27"],"eps_avg":0.22007,"eps_low":0.18,"eps_high":0.25,"revenue_avg":1989854620,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-20","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.5502,"institutions_pct":0.17257,"institutions_float_pct":0.38366002,"institutions_n":169,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0063,"shares":2059782,"value":26612383,"date":"2026-04-30","chg":0.019199999},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0042,"shares":1369548,"value":17694560,"date":"2026-03-31","chg":0.0324},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0041,"shares":1348167,"value":17418317,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Victory Portfolios-Victory Trivalent International Small-Cap Fund","pct":0.003,"shares":982706,"value":12696561,"date":"2026-03-31","chg":-0.00029999999},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT TRUST CO-The Continental Small Company Series","pct":0.0029,"shares":956295,"value":12355331,"date":"2026-04-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Old Westbury Funds Inc-Old Westbury Small & Mid Cap Strategies Fund","pct":0.0028,"shares":914903,"value":11820546,"date":"2026-04-30","chg":0.0139999995},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-Intl Core Eqy. 2 PORT.","pct":0.0019,"shares":626222,"value":8090788,"date":"2026-04-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares MSCI EAFE Small-Cap ETF","pct":0.0018000001,"shares":592234,"value":7651663,"d